    "M7-W01-C02-T2-C"
  ],
  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Complete M7-W01-C02-T2 as an explicit tensor-provider/API deferral backed by immutable RS108 rank-three shape and 64-element/512-byte refusal evidence. Reexecute independent T1 BCL oracles and document three owner-gated re-entry conditions. Close C02 as a research spike only; M7-W01/M7 remain active, without Tensor product delivery.",
    "value": "An independent C# gate verifies prior source SHA pins, exact 2x2x2 indexing/sum and invalid shape/resource boundaries, plus explicit non-admission of managed/native tensors, broadcasting, sparse and GPU. Require consumer need, shape/budget semantics and provider license/RID/source-free proof before reconsideration.",
    "nextAction": "After durable RS109 success, prepare only the accepted next M7-W01-C03 research scope after splitting its size-L DAG/PlotModel phase into bounded deliverables; preserve Math/AURA separation, node/point caps and independent 1/x discontinuity and diamond-DAG oracles.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "No new Tensor API or managed/native/GPU tensor runtime is admitted from completed rank-three research fixtures.",
      "Future tensor admission requires a named consumer gap, explicit rank/shape/stride/alias and byte/element budgets.",
      "Require exact source/version/license/RID/rights, offline rollback and independent source-free consumer qualification before any provider cutover.",
      "A research-only 64-element/512-byte cap is not an externally shipped Math performance or numerical guarantee.",
      "M7-W01-C03 is size-L; split before readiness and keep AURA job scheduling/visualization outside Math."
    ],
    "achievements": [
      {
        "projectNode": "M7-W01-C02-T2-A",
        "achievement": "Identify the precise consumer, bounded tensor semantics and owner-gated re-entry conditions for research disposition."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M7-W01-C02-T2-B",
        "achievement": "Recheck RS108 source SHA identities, independent shape/index/budget oracles and the absent source-free tensor provider evidence."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M7-W01-C02-T2-C",
        "achievement": "Explicitly defer new Tensor public APIs and providers; retain Math numerical contracts, ownership boundaries and negative-cutover policy."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M7-W01-C02-T2",
        "achievement": "Qualify independent C# tensor boundary gate and the three re-entry triggers without implementing a product tensor package."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M7-W01-C02",
        "achievement": "Close the accepted tensor research spike through evidence-backed deferral, not a delivered Tensor API or provider integration."
      }
    ]
  },
